        "question_text": "<p>Find the coefficient of $x^3$ in the expansion of $(2x - 3)^5$.</p>",
        "question_image": null,
        "answer_image": null,
        "explanation": "<p>Use the Binomial Theorem: $(2x - 3)^5 = \\sum_{k=0}^{5} \\binom{5}{k} (2x)^{5-k} (-3)^k$.<br>The term containing $x^3$ occurs when $5 - k = 3$, i.e., $k = 2$.<br>Thus, the coefficient is $\\binom{5}{2} (2)^{3} (-3)^2 = 10 \\times 8 \\times 9 = 720$.</p>",
